{"data": {"uuid": "8f5a16f2-5a4d-4a7f-b625-94bae1d16506", "slug": "metis", "name": "Metis", "class_name": "QDRV_RSI_S03_Metis_SCItem", "classification": "Ship.QuantumDrive", "classification_label": "Quantum Drive", "description": {"en_EN": "There's no room for error when bending space and time to travel incredible distances. So put your trust in RSI, a company that's delivered quality components to the public since the dawn of space flight.", "de_DE": "Hersteller: RSI\nTyp (En): Quantum Drive\nTyp (De): Quantenantrieb\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S3\nG\u00fctegrad: C\nKlasse: Civilian (Zivil)\n\nEs gibt keinen Platz f\u00fcr Fehler, wenn es darum geht, Raum und Zeit zu biegen, um unglaubliche Entfernungen zu \u00fcberwinden. Vertraue also RSI, einem Unternehmen, das seit den Anf\u00e4ngen des Raumfluges hochwertige Komponenten an die \u00d6ffentlichkeit liefert.", "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1aRSI\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a3\n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1aC\n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u6c11\u7528\n\n\u5728\u5f2f\u66f2\u65f6\u7a7a\u7684\u6f2b\u957f\u8def\u9014\u4e2d\u6ca1\u6709\u4e00\u4e1d\u51fa\u9519\u7684\u4f59\u5730.RSI\u5728\u4eba\u7c7b\u8fdb\u5165\u592a\u7a7a\u4e4b\u59cb\u4fbf\u5f00\u59cb\u5411\u516c\u4f17\u63d0\u4f9b\u4f18\u8d28\u4ea7\u54c1 900\u5e74\u8001\u5b57\u53f7\u503c\u5f97\u4f60\u7684\u4fe1\u8d56\u3002", "fr_FR": "Type d'article : Propulseur quantique\nFabricant : RSI\nTaille : 3\nQualit\u00e9 : C\nClasse : Civile\n\nIl n'y a pas de place pour l'erreur lorsque l'on plie l'espace et le temps pour parcourir des distances incroyables. Faites donc confiance \u00e0 RSI, une entreprise qui fournit des composants de qualit\u00e9 au grand public depuis l'aube du vol spatial."}, "size": 3, "mass": 1900, "event_source": [], "is_base_variant": true, "is_craftable": true, "is_lootable": false, "blueprint": [{"uuid": "b4956cef-f30c-4bc4-9701-1f539cbe8ba6", "name": "Metis", "link": "https://api.star-citizen.wiki/api/blueprints/b4956cef-f3